e  pain did it give you a different outlook  or a different idea of what love is and  what it potentially could be just going  through writing in yeah yeah I mean I'm  I think you know who love is a funny  thing and there are different versions  of it I think different people have  different ideas about love different  approaches to love and I think that's  all a part of life and learning and  growing is you you figure out what those  are but as far as writing and I just  think that writing for me has always  been a form of release whether it's in  song form or just in a diary that nobody  will ever see it's always since I was I  mean I mean as far back as I can  remember I've always written down what  I've felt and so it's it's definitely I  recommend it to anybody going through  something because I do think it's such a  great form of release yeah now this is  half written story so what is the other  half of the story sound like and feel  like well because you know how to wait  and see you know obviously with  everything that's going on in the world  things have changed for for everyone  everywhere and especially as far as you  know scheduling and with this project I  really just wanted to get these records  out that I love and I'm so proud of and  I'm feeling my fans have been so  incredibly patient  I don't know how they've hung on for  this long but I wanted to you know give  them the little treat that is half  written story in the meantime as I  continue working on the bigger body work

